        "Schedules (conditional.json): inputTokens = input + input_cached + cache_write_30m + cache_write_12h. Up to 272000: input 2, input_cached 0.1, cache_write_30m 2.5, cache_write_12h 5, output 10. Above 272000: input 4, input_cached 0.2, cache writes unsupported, output 15 (all per 10^6 tokens).",
        "conditionInputs.inputTokens is unknown: every schedule is evaluated for the estimated quantities.",
        "schedule 0: 0.4 + 0.0072 + 0.01 = 0.4172",
        "schedule 1: 200000 * 4 / 10^6 + 72000 * 0.2 / 10^6 + 1000 * 15 / 10^6 = 0.8 + 0.0144 + 0.015 = 0.8294",
